<title>UK: Sole Brent cargo kept by BP.</title>
<headline>Sole Brent cargo kept by BP.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The sole Brent date nominated into the forward paper chains on Wednesday was kept by BP, traders said.</p>
<p>BP is believed to be holding six to seven October loading Brent cargoes, including Wednesday's October 10-12 cargo.</p>
<p>An October 3-5 Brent cargo was sold at a firmer November +6 cents, up three cents from Tuesday's levels, traders said.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4088</p>
